      "source": "The value of this property is [`ARGeoAnchor.AltitudeSource.userDefined`](argeoanchor/altitudesource-swift.enum/userdefined.md) if you set the altitude yourself (see [`getGeoLocation(forPoint:completionHandler:)`](arsession/getgeolocation(forpoint:completionhandler:).md)).",
